<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>WAYU</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>

*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{

font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;

background:
linear-gradient(rgba(0,0,0,.75),rgba(0,0,0,.75)),
url("background.jpg");

background-size:cover;
background-position:center;
background-attachment:fixed;

color:white;

}

.container{

max-width:1200px;
margin:auto;
padding:60px 25px;

}

header{

text-align:center;
margin-bottom:60px;

}

header h1{

font-size:clamp(70px,12vw,140px);

letter-spacing:.28em;

font-weight:700;

margin-bottom:10px;

}

.subtitle{

font-size:18px;

letter-spacing:3px;

color:#d7d7d7;

text-transform:uppercase;

}

.line{

width:120px;

height:2px;

background:#D4AF37;

margin:35px auto;

}

.description{

max-width:720px;

margin:auto;

font-size:18px;

line-height:1.8;

color:#e8e8e8;

}

.follow{

margin:80px auto;

text-align:center;

background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);

backdrop-filter:blur(14px);

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);

border-radius:24px;

padding:50px;

max-width:700px;

box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.35);

}

.follow h2{

font-size:34px;

letter-spacing:5px;

margin-bottom:15px;

color:#D4AF37;

}

.follow p{

color:#ddd;

margin-bottom:30px;

}

.qr{

width:220px;

background:white;

padding:18px;

border-radius:20px;

box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(255,255,255,.25);

transition:.35s;

}

.qr:hover{

transform:scale(1.05);

}

.social{

margin-top:25px;

letter-spacing:3px;

color:#ddd;

font-size:15px;

}

.members-title{

text-align:center;

margin:90px 0 40px;

font-size:38px;

letter-spacing:5px;

color:#D4AF37;

}

.members{

display:grid;

grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));

gap:25px;

}

.card{

background:rgba(255,255,255,.07);

backdrop-filter:blur(10px);

border-radius:20px;

padding:35px 25px;

border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);

transition:.35s;

text-align:center;

}

.card:hover{

transform:translateY(-8px);

border-color:#D4AF37;

box-shadow:0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.35);

}

.role{

font-size:13px;

letter-spacing:3px;

text-transform:uppercase;

color:#D4AF37;

margin-bottom:12px;

}

.name{

font-size:28px;

font-weight:700;

margin-bottom:15px;

}

.handle{

font-size:15px;

color:#ddd;

line-height:1.7;

}

footer{

margin-top:90px;

padding:40px;

text-align:center;

color:#bdbdbd;

letter-spacing:2px;

font-size:14px;

border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);

}

@media(max-width:768px){

header h1{

letter-spacing:.15em;

}

.follow{

padding:35px 20px;

}

.qr{

width:180px;

}

}

</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<header>

<h1>WAYU</h1>

<div class="subtitle">

A CONTEMPORARY MUSIC COLLECTIVE

</div>

<div class="line"></div>

<div class="description">

WAYU is a contemporary music collective from the Conservatory of Music at Rangsit University. Blending creativity, performance, and collaboration, the ensemble represents a new generation of musicians connecting audiences through modern music.

</div>

</header>

<section class="follow">

<h2>SCAN TO FOLLOW</h2>

<p>

Follow WAYU and stay connected with our latest performances, music, and behind-the-scenes moments.

</p>

<img src="qr.png" class="qr" alt="QR Code">

<div class="social">

Instagram • TikTok • YouTube

</div>

</section>

<h2 class="members-title">

THE ARTISTS

</h2>

<section class="members">

